        "content_hash": "f862606ca84af2bf29414b9d3628df4b57064189d917a2536e79fd0bdf07f454"
      },
      "natural_statement": "For h=25, the same all-role construction has m=15625, W=58645352620000, Delta=3703000000, W_star=2^46 and lambda=17179869126140625/1099511627776. Its charged tensor bound holds for every k>=0, and 1-log_15625(lambda) is greater than 1500 times the corresponding gap for the padded h=100 construction.",
      "formal_statement": "",
